{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04777","headline":"相州冬日早衙 · 张说","name":"相州冬日早衙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城外宵钟敛，闺中曙火残。\n朝光曜庭雪，宿冻聚池寒。\n正色临厅事，疑词定笔端。\n除苛囹圄息，伐枳吏人宽。\n河内功犹浅，淮阳疾未安。\n镜中星髪变，顿使世情阑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04777.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04777","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}